# `forge doc` writes a runnable vocs site scaffold next to the generated pages. Only the
# pages are worth committing: the scaffold is reproduced by `forge doc` on demand, it
# carries the checked-out branch in its edit links, and its package.json pulls the whole
# vocs/waku npm tree into dependency scanning for a site nothing in CI builds.
